# `permissions.list`

List permission presets across scopes.

**Policy** — read (C0, safe). Capability `ship.permissions.read`.

## Arguments

None.

## Returns

`PermissionsIndexResponse` (JSON).

| field | type |
|-------|------|
| `items` | `map` |

## Invoke

```
ship ops call permissions.list --json '{}'
```

Kind: read.

## Example response

```json
{
  "items": [
    {
      "id": "allow-bash-read",
      "scope": "project"
    },
    {
      "id": "allow-read",
      "scope": "project"
    },
    {
      "id": "deny-rm-rf",
      "scope": "project"
    }
  ]
}
```
